<title>FRANCE: BIC Q3 sales rise 11 pct.</title>
<headline>BIC Q3 sales rise 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 1,737    vs  1,559</p>
<p>    Nine-month turnover			  4,929    vs  4,650</p>
<p>NOTE - BIC issued third-quarter and nine-month sales in a financial advertisement.</p>
<p>It said third-quarter sales rose 11 percent and nine-month sales rose six percent.</p>
<p>Third-quarter sales rose 15 percent in the BIC branch but fell 36 percent in the Guy Laroche business.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
